WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.640
but we're not going to quit.

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.240
And Turning Point USA is continuing the tour

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.480
that Charlie was on.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.440
We had 6,000 people when we went back to Utah.

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:11.160
We had 5,000 people last night in Montana,

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.300
if you can believe that.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.320
We are continuing to organize on campus.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.920
We are getting more and more people coming out

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:19.639
in the face of this threat,

00:00:19.639 --> 00:00:21.680
knowing what happened to Charlie.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:22.520
But Mr. President.

